fallibile fino a quel momento, commette un errore. Scampato per un soffio alla tragedia, l'equipaggio approda a Brest, dove Chanteraide deve rispondere ai suoi superiori della défaillance. Ma una serie di eventi catastrofici, che rischiano di imbarcare l'Europa in una guerra nucleare, lo obbligano a risalire a bordo. E questa volta la missione è davvero impossibile.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2019-02-20","status":"Released","rating":7.511,"ratingCount":2219,"genres":["Thriller","Azione","Avventura"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"115m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":78124,"name":"François Civil","role":"Chanteraide","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vSkggoDmEHl820VMBzpGkjARU2z.jpg"},{"id":78423,"name":"Omar Sy","role":"D'Orsi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Uuy6WuizieB4fOIGFp0gY90Yq2.jpg"},{"id":2406,"name":"Mathieu Kassovitz","role":"Alfost","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3FRBEdKKlxhvPWPt0jzgmSjeHwn.jpg"},{"id":89626,"name":"Reda Kateb","role":"Grandchamp","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mvDuT7covYkAjK2Ix2VHJcvPyE0.jpg"},{"id":894116,"name":"Paula Beer","role":"Diana","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kNMRhurFbvedI3rf8gP92Bbwsen.jpg"},{"id":431148,"name":"Alexis Michalik","role":"Second SNLE-B2R","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mTkQ8zxBj9uIFJeN5yR3uKOGMnk.jpg"},{"id":34259,"name":"Jean-Yves Berteloot","role":"Commander CIRA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x8uFQOAsLSbWcbRMyItUj2nMZuo.jpg"},{"id":579211,"name":"Damien Bonnard","role":"Navigation officer SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jZLowoW3gGxKbrscwZintPBsQR5.jpg"},{"id":1407367,"name":"Pierre Cévaër","role":"Sonar watchman SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7tWEI7s8USICKYUv6e6y0QipoNJ.jpg"},{"id":1380406,"name":"Sébastien Libessart","role":"Cadet SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4fgqwPGP9Ui5cAncx5xsgqiyxpu.jpg"},{"id":1344818,"name":"Paul Granier","role":"Table operator SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lOzybFPKgExqhGZsV9Avlpwr09V.jpg"},{"id":2483735,"name":"Etienne Guillou-Kervern","role":"Plant master","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hbNAiy6lw4yKb1oA5hFvSANVP6b.jpg"},{"id":1556117,"name":"Guillaume Duhesme","role":"Elaboration SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jfMqHULJwzrYT4QaGgX7avkMt5j.jpg"},{"id":2244663,"name":"Simon Thomas","role":"Coxswain SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mP3dq22OnulWANJedCRQWjSvDat.jpg"},{"id":1075115,"name":"Bastien Ughetto","role":"Torpedo operator SNA","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6zeyplgO0ijOXrJ3KwAEdfT4AlS.jpg"},{"id":381663,"name":"Marc Ruchmann","role":"Cadet SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jj3Wn3B6zncjBEkjYjH4ZyqTvMC.jpg"},{"id":1643601,"name":"Nicolas Van Beveren","role":"Shooting officer SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpwwOOb5Yug13CtMLr73Z5RVz90.jpg"},{"id":2644770,"name":"Sébastien Landry","role":"Central master SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gsdYIo92LcyWky6N9twBdKXsZ6t.jpg"},{"id":1716084,"name":"Sylvain Loreau","role":"Elaboration SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gjZRsxrTQkgeZoDjMQgzZysfisq.jpg"},{"id":1058064,"name":"Arthur Choisnet","role":"Torpedo operator SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/56tzwcW4vm4A0dZp4WQ8O2Qjrlc.jpg"},{"id":1988229,"name":"Léopold Bara","role":"Cotac SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2U4UVNrEkPd1cm0BuBWGDrY6Fux.jpg"},{"id":1167058,"name":"Arnaud Churin","role":"Head of PC middle SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cHzP8q8ph3XqOa9NzBYj3FOIUNT.jpg"},{"id":2496206,"name":"Brice Ormain","role":"Cerrudon SNLE","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qi0SYTZhdnY7xCTPnfZGwXSQ3qZ.jpg"},{"id":2090929,"name":"Guillaume Clement","role":"Squadron leader","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uP1YBGm3SVPp8JYRsCFACsZKmPJ.jpg"},{"id":1316048,"name":"Stefan Godin","role":"Captain","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2ZhTomxLiyPVReNAq9isl0xuVRV.jpg"},{"id":1683645,"name":"Philippe Maymat","role":"Chief of Staff of the President","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b4xWim1N1i1dh3kYfO9jzIksXjB.jpg"},{"id":2327188,"name":"Jonathan Devred","role":"Cotac","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5E77xOwO68MfO6dxF3Z88YKeWO.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Wolf Call - Minaccia in alto mare","overview":"Il 'canto del lupo' è il nome in codice di un sonar nemico. È l'appello allarmante di un pericolo in avvicinamento, che solo un 'orecchio d'oro' può avvertire. Analista acustico dall'udito eccezionale, Chanteraide si è guadagnato quel soprannome nel suo campo che è il mare. Giovane militare della marina francese, è piombato nel mezzo di un'operazione al largo della Siria. Lo scopo della missione è recuperare un gruppo di soldati in attesa sulla spiaggia. Ma le cose si complicano per la presenza di un sottomarino nemico. A Chanteraide decifrare la minaccia e la sua posizione. Infallibile fino a quel momento, commette un errore. Scampato per un soffio alla tragedia, l'equipaggio approda a Brest, dove Chanteraide deve rispondere ai suoi superiori della défaillance. Ma una serie di eventi catastrofici, che rischiano di imbarcare l'Europa in una guerra nucleare, lo obbligano a risalire a bordo. E questa volta la missione è davvero impossibile."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Wolf's Call","overview":"Shown from the perspective of a young submariner with unusually sensitive hearing and uncannily precise sound recognition. The fate of many often depends on his ability, and one time, whilst highly stressed, he makes a incorrect call which put his entire crew in mortal danger.  Trying to regain the confidence of his comrades, he conducts an unauthorised investigation of an apparent plot which, it turns out, risks escalating into a nuclear apocalypse. Suddenly working under pressure with the fleet admiral, they must do whatever is necessary, even the unthinkable, to prevent a nuclear war, since a confirmed nuclear strike order cannot be countermanded."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Un jeune homme a le don rare de reconnaître chaque son qu’il entend. A bord d’un sous-marin nucléaire français, tout repose sur lui, l’Oreille d’Or.  Réputé infaillible, il commet pourtant une erreur qui met l’équipage en danger de mort. Il veut retrouver la confiance de ses camarades mais sa quête les entraîne dans une situation encore plus dramatique. Dans le monde de la dissuasion nucléaire et de la désinformation, ils se retrouvent tous pris au piège d’un engrenage incontrôlable."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDyCvNWaFkkrgf0QjhHqpCGVc8p.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ujd2rMIVb0Z8orWrEbMWdJsBRYd.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":484468,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDyCvNWaFkkrgf0QjhHqpCGVc8p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fDyCvNWaFkkrgf0QjhHqpCGVc8p.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDyCvNWaFkkrgf0QjhHqpCGVc8p.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fDyCvNWaFkkrgf0QjhHqpCGVc8p.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":999},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arW4ur7lZpxgW0HOpKOBmiJMdO6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/arW4ur7lZpxgW0HOpKOBmiJMdO6.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qXd6KXzF1cPAwae69raE5ibRHyp.jpg","previ